{"title":"CSS: List of Elements","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"border:1px solid black; background:#CEE0F2;text-align:center;\" align=\"center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#B0C4DE;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS\" title=\"CSS\">CSS</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS:_Basics\" title=\"CSS: Basics\">Basics</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS:_Backgrounds\" title=\"CSS: Backgrounds\">Backgrounds</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS:_Text\" title=\"CSS: Text\">Text</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS:_Box_Model\" title=\"CSS: Box Model\">Box Model</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS:_Selectors_and_Combinators\" title=\"CSS: Selectors and Combinators\">Selectors and Combinators</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS:_Pseudo-class_and_Pseudo-element\" title=\"CSS: Pseudo-class and Pseudo-element\">Pseudo-class and Pseudo-element</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS:_Gradients&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"CSS: Gradients (page does not exist)\">Gradients</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS:_Animations_and_Transitions\" title=\"CSS: Animations and Transitions\">Animations and Transitions</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS:_CSS_in_AoPS\" title=\"CSS: CSS in AoPS\">CSS in AoPS</a> - <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">List of Elements</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>This is a list of CSS elements that is used for the blogs in AoPS.\n</p><p>NOTE: Text in <span style=\"color: #888;\">gray</span> are comments designed for clarity and should not be included in your CSS.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Main_Elements\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Main Elements</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Main_Content\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Main Content</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Entries/Comments\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Entries/Comments</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Polls\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Polls</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Misc.\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Misc.</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Side\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Side</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Shouts\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Shouts</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Header\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Header</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Navigation_Box\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Navigation Box</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Posting/Commenting\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Posting/Commenting</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Other\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Main_Elements\">Main Elements</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS:_List_of_Elements&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Main Elements\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>body</li>\n<li>div#wrapper</li>\n<li>div#content</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Main_Content\">Main Content</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS:_List_of_Elements&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Main Content\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>div#main</li></ul>\n<h3><span id=\"Entries.2FComments\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Entries/Comments\">Entries/Comments</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS:_List_of_Elements&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Entries/Comments\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>div.entry <span style=\"color: #888;\">Includes the blog entry and its title</span></li>\n<li>div.entrywrap  <span style=\"color: #888;\">Includes the blog entry minus its title</span></li>\n<li>div.comment</li>\n<li>div.commentwrap</li>\n<li>div.message  <span style=\"color: #888;\">The area containing actual text of the message or comment</span></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<ul><li>.entry h2 &gt; img <span style=\"color: #888; margin-left: 1em; -webkit-user-select: none; -moz-user-select: none; -ms-user-select: none; user-select: none;\">Selects the image to the left of the h2.</span></li>\n<li>div.efooter</li>\n<li>div.cfooter</li>\n<li>div.actions</li>\n<li>div.modactions</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Polls\">Polls</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS:_List_of_Elements&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Polls\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>div.cmty-poll-display</li>\n<li>.cmty-poll-result-bar</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Misc.\">Misc.</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS:_List_of_Elements&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Misc.\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>p#post-new-entry-p</li>\n<li>img#post-new-entry-img</li>\n<li>a#post-new-entry</li>\n<li>div.total-posts</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Side\">Side</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS:_List_of_Elements&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Side\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>div#side <span style=\"color: #888; margin-left: 1em; -webkit-user-select: none; -moz-user-select: none; -ms-user-select: none; user-select: none;\">This is the sidebar.</span></li>\n<li>div#user-menu-widget <span style=\"color: #888; margin-left: 1em; -webkit-user-select: none; -moz-user-select: none; -ms-user-select: none; user-select: none;\">This is the blog description.</span></li>\n<li>div#archives-widget <span style=\"color: #888; margin-left: 1em; -webkit-user-select: none; -moz-user-select: none; -ms-user-select: none; user-select: none;\">Use this for the archives widget.</span></li>\n<li>div#shouts-widget</li>\n<li>div#contrib-widget</li>\n<li>div#tags-widget</li>\n<li>div#categories-widget</li>\n<li>div#about-owner-widget</li>\n<li>div#stats-widget</li>\n<li>div.widget:not([id]) <span style=\"color: #888; margin-left: 1em; -webkit-user-select: none; -moz-user-select: none; -ms-user-select: none; user-select: none;\">This is the search widget, which does not have a specific ID.</span></li>\n<li>div#feed-widget <span style=\"color: #888; margin-left: 1em; -webkit-user-select: none; -moz-user-select: none; -ms-user-select: none; user-select: none;\">Appears only on the front page of a blog.</span></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Shouts\">Shouts</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS:_List_of_Elements&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Shouts\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>li.row1, li.row2 <span style=\"color: #888; margin-left: 1em; -webkit-user-select: none; -moz-user-select: none; -ms-user-select: none; user-select: none;\">Use these to select the individual shouts.</span></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Header\">Header</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS:_List_of_Elements&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Header\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>div#header</li>\n<li>div#header h1</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Navigation_Box\">Navigation Box</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS:_List_of_Elements&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Navigation Box\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>div#navigation_box</li>\n<li>div#left_navigation_box</li>\n<li>div#right_navigation_box</li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\"Posting.2FCommenting\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Posting/Commenting\">Posting/Commenting</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS:_List_of_Elements&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Posting/Commenting\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other\">Other</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS:_List_of_Elements&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Other\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>h1</li>\n<li>h2</li>\n<li>a</li>\n<li>span.hidden-text</li>\n<li>input</li>\n<li>select</li>\n<li>textarea</li>\n<li>inputbox</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018075414\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.064 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 49/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 600/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.350      1 Template:CSS\n100.00%    5.350      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:10599:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018075414 and revision id 291774. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}